# Virtual : for EvalMath only
* starts with #, it returns the Fname int value. eg #C3S1 > 1230192. useful for comparing values that returns a fname int.

* V.Item.Count.XXX returns the count of the item XXX on inventory
* V.Item.Cur > returns fname int for current selected item
* V.FB.Val fb val
* V.FB.ValTo fb val to
* V.Story.Step.Cur > fname int value for the current step
* V.inter.Cur.name > the fname int value for the current hovered interact actor
* v.inter.cur.state > the int state for the current hovered interact actor
* V.Inter.State.XXX > the state of the inter with that (outliner) name
* v.Feat.Get > returns the feat by its int id (you'll have to find it)
* v.Sys.IsDebug > 1 if debug, 0 otherwise.
* v.Sys.IsEditor > 1 if editor, 0 otherwise.

